            <title><![CDATA[Projections show no clear winner in Israel's election]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/projections-show-no-clear-winner-in-israels-election</link>
            <description><![CDATA[Israelis turned out in record numbers for their first election since the Oct. 7 attacks and the war in Gaza. Projections show opposition parties won more seats than the coalition led by Prime Minister Netanyahu, potentially setting the stage for a change in government. But Netanyahu's opponents do not have enough seats to form a majority, leading to weeks of negotiations. Nick Schifrin reports.]]></description>
